Explanation
This program acts as a simple information management expert system that stores and manages records.


It uses a dictionary (database) to store data in the form of key-value pairs.


It provides suggestions like an expert system based on user actions.



Working


User selects options from menu.


System performs operations like:


Add Record → stores new data


View Records → displays all records


Search Record → finds specific record and gives suggestion


Delete Record → removes record




System continues until user selects Exit.



Functions Used


add_record() → adds new record


view_records() → displays all records


search_record() → searches record


delete_record() → deletes record


menu() → controls program flow



Output


Displays stored records


Shows search results with suggestions


Performs add/delete operations successfully


